<p><b>Melanocetus%21johnsonii</b> is a viperfish-themed lang based on <a href="/wiki/Deadfish" title="Deadfish">Deadfish</a>//<a href="/wiki/Alivefish" title="Alivefish">Alivefish</a>. It is oddly similar to <a href="/wiki/XKCD" title="XKCD">XKCD</a>.
</p>
