<th>Command
</th>
<th>Description
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>M</code>
</td>
<td>Mainlines the accumulator
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>no</code>
</td>
<td>Main accumulator becomes accumulator 1
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>ii</code>
</td>
<td>Squares accumulator 1
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>#!</code>
</td>
<td>Outputs a space; accumulator 1 converts contents to 2 then mains the accumulator.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>jJ</code>
</td>
<td>Jimmys the contents of accumulator 2 and converts the contents of main to 5;Letter e converts to 51,Zeta
</td></tr>
