<td>Converts letter z to .
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><code>*v</code>
</td>
<td>Generates random base52 string and converts 5 to a letter v and converts 2 to a number 47.
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Conversion">Conversion</span></h3>
